only rights the Licensor is entitled to license. Third-Party Material is excluded.

**You** means an individual exercising the permissions below. A company,
organization or other entity does not receive a license under the individual-use
grant merely because its employees or users are individuals.

**Personal Use** means operating the Software for Your own individual workflows,
including creating, publishing and monetizing Your own creative work. It may
include running the Software on a machine or private server under Your control,
or connecting it to Your own skills, plugins, agents and MCP clients. Personal
Use does not include providing the Software's functionality to other users,
operating it for an organization, or incorporating it into a product or service
offered to others. A service used privately as a client or infrastructure does
not, by that fact alone, become an integration offered to others.

**Third-Party Material** means material governed by separate rights or terms,
